WEBVTT

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.640
What beautiful weather...

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:43.110
Wage workers heading to the office in the
torrential rain with flimsy umbrellas...

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.730
Packed in rush-hour trains that
barely allow them to breathe...

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.900
Oh, how tough life must be
for the common folk...

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.950
"They forced me to go in to work today.
There won't be any customers in this
storm! Close the damn store, dammit!
#typhoon #GoToWork"

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:52.950
"'Come to work as usual'...?
#typhoon #GoToWork"

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.700
"Umbrella lasted for 30 seconds after
leaving the house. I'm sorry, there's
somewhere I have to be (the office)
#typhoon #GoToWork"

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.910
I did it! I finally did it!

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:01.920
I have evolved into the ultimate NEET...

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.420
The Uber Pro NEET!

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:08.880
My hard work up to this point
has finally paid off!

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.260
I saved up my allowances to pour
into swing trading to build up capital,

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:14.760
which I then invested
into overseas real estate.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:19.600
The income from overseas became a stable
income stream with no work involved!

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.940
After establishing the foundation
for earning money without working,

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:22.940
"Land for sale"

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:24.770
I built three apartments in Tokyo,

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:29.030
and built my castle on
the top floor of one of them!

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:34.530
The uber NEET life that other losers
can never experience!

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:39.240
I don't mind if this
becomes my final abode!

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:45.880
The alpha and the omega, I shall live
here slothfully until the day I die!

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:50.210
What?!

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.480
What in the world is going on...?

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:16.700
Huh?

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:20.080
What's this...?

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:26.000
The Dungeon of Black Company

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:31.170
Episode 1: Welcome to the World of Corporate Grunts

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:31.170
My dear fellow workers, I have
an important question to ask you,

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:34.010
before we start today's morning gathering!

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:37.550
Are you working like
your life depends on it?

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:41.520
Are you doing everything you can
possibly do to beat our competitors?

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:45.640
If you aren't risking your life,
if you aren't ready to do so,

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:49.150
please, just once, try sacrificing
food and sleep to get results!

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:53.360
The thanks you gather from our clients,
the results you create through labor...

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:59.410
All of that will certainly become a
timeless treasure called "fulfillment"!

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:03.870
What a bunch of self-serving nonsense...

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:03.870
It will become the most
important thing in your life!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.660
Work is the uncut gem
that becomes fulfillment!

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.630
Let infinite work shine
brightly in your heart,

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:12.880
and put in your all,
just do it, it's do or die!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:17.760
Kinji Ninomiya, 24,
formerly an uber NEET.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:21.760
One day, he arrived in a foreign world,
Amuria, inhabited by demihumans.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.560
In ancient times,
the dungeons of this world

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:27.560
were packed with monsters and treasure.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:32.230
Humans with power tackled these
dungeons seeking fame and glory.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.900
However, as modernization took over,
that changed dramatically.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:40.200
"Demonite," the ore found in dungeons,
started being used as an energy source.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:45.120
Governments and companies licensed
by them began managing the dungeons.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:48.540
One of those companies,
the Raiza'ha Mining Corporation,

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:52.710
manages the demonite mines in the Ruins
of Detmolt, which is where Kinji ended up.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.430
Oh, no! Mr. Saruyama is dancing naked!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:03.430
Saruyama-<i>senpai </i>hasn't taken a
single day off for the last three months.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.720
Has he reached his limit?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.560
Probably.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.770
Mr. Saruyama! Don't go that way!

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.900
--That's a different division's area!
--Let's go! Onwards!

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:16.690
Hey, Ninomiya, you wanna hear
last month's results?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:17.950
Nah, no thanks.

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.240
What do you mean "no thanks"?!

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:23.700
You only reached 15% of your quota!
That's not even funny!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:28.120
Thanks to you dragging us down, our whole
group's evaluation got dropped a tier!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.290
I didn't feel well last month...

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.590
It ain't work until you
mess up your health!

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:37.340
Listen, back in my day...

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.090
Enough, idiot!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.430
Dammit, dammit, dammit!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.600
Why...

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:50.890
Why must I toil in the muddy pits
with these losers...?

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:55.480
Sixteen-hour work-days with
barely any rest each week...

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:59.740
Assigned dormitories with absolutely
no privacy, just packed sleeping floors!

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:02.240
Bathing only once every month!

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.780
This is wrong!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:08.620
Why me?! Why this idiotic
parallel universe?! Why?!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:13.290
Hey, Wanibe!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.750
Y-Yes sir! What is it...?

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:19.420
I told you, if you don't
know something, ask!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.930
Why did you do that thing you did,
just now?!

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:25.050
Well, you told me I need to learn
by watching others do...

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.260
What?!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.640
Report, remind, review!
Don't forget the "Three R's"!

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:30.680
Repeat it!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:31.690
Uh, report...

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:34.270
Louder!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:37.520
Oh, so hungry...

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.240
Last month's salary, 130 thousand gold...

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:45.530
Various deductions from my loan,
which leaves 10 thousand gold...

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:49.950
I never thought I'd be in a place where
a loaf of bread feels like a feast...

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.370
No!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.460
Wait, please wait!

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.380
Without you, I... I...!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:06:01.300
I'd have nothing to eat tomorrow!

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:03.340
No!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.900
Hey there!

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:21.610
You got a moment, Mr. Wanibe?

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:26.490
Um, uh...

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.990
You're Ninomiya,
from the same team as me, right?

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:36.580
Team leader got real mad,
said you went missing this afternoon.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:40.130
Heh, ignore that ape.

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:43.840
By the way, this place
seems really expensive...

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.890
How can you afford this place?
We both get paid the same.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:49.180
I don't have any money.

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.010
Huh?

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.390
I just went out and borrowed some.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:56.600
I heard a rumor that you
already owe 10 million gold--

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.940
No. It's 20 million.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:03.280
Back then, I had no money...
Or rather, I had nothing at all.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:06.320
It's a magic tablet, touch it
and the pictures change!

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.320
I tried to make some money
using the only asset that I had,

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.160
so I brought business to someone
who I thought was appropriate.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.660
It's a magic tablet, touch it
and the pictures change!

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.160
I see...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.830
But when they found out
it didn't make any money,

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.670
they accused me of fraud and attacked me.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:19.840
How shallow can
common people be, really?

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.840
--Hey, this doesn't work!
--It doesn't flash!

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:23.920
And now I'm stuck here
in this dead-end company.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:28.340
Um, I almost forgot. I have an urgent
appointment, so I gotta go...

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:31.180
What, to repeat the "Three R's" again?

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.060
You have a dull look.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:39.520
The look of a guy with no money, no
specialties, nothing to look forward to.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:42.400
This could be your golden opportunity.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.730
Golden opportunity?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:48.490
The last chance for you to stop
being who you were until today.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.120
Hey! Ninomiya!

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.660
Where did you run off to yesterday--?

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:55.660
Leader.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.540
Huh?

00:07:56.540 --> 00:08:00.000
Can we go on a "prospecting tour" today?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.880
Really? Would you do that for us?!

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:09.220
Good, good. That's great! You're finally
starting to grow a backbone!

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:06.920
Seriously?

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.220
Are they nuts?

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:12.470
I still have a lot to teach you,
but good luck!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:15.020
Although, we don't
compensate for injuries...

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.890
It's the most fulfilling way to work!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:21.940
The "prospecting tour" is a slang term
used at the Raiza'ha Mining Corporation.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:26.860
A small party of workers goes deep
into the dungeon to find demonite.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.160
Kinji and the others usually
work on the first floor.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.950
The dungeon goes deeper down,
floor after floor, almost endlessly.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:37.700
The deeper one goes, the more dangerous
the monsters that lurk there.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:38.870
But...

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.750
They say even on the second floor, the
value of the demonite is 10 times more.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:46.840
If we find any other rare ores,
we get a bonus.

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:50.550
Yes, but... It's too dangerous.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:55.600
They say several people from the
Exploration Division die every year.

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:56.970
Just watch.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.190
It disappeared?

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:05.440
A hidden portal.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:08.650
A secret passage to the third floor.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.070
Are you sure this is safe...?

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:14.990
I spent hours yesterday
making sure we'd be safe!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:19.830
Leather cape: 3,500G
Adventurer's armor 11,500G 
per month for 6 months

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.870
A leather cape and adventurer's armor,

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.040
that's not much in terms of equipment...

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:24.380
Don't be greedy. Besides, it's not
like we're looking for a fight.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.600
Bingo.

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:39.600
Wow... This is all demonite?!

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:44.690
Is this holy water, for warding off evil?

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.730
Yeah, it should keep
the monsters away for a while.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:51.400
You take the left side,
I'll get the right side.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.490
O-Okay...

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:59.870
Hey, thank you, Ninomiya.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:02.410
As you see, I'm slow.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:06.290
People always tell me
I'm a slow learner at work.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:10.010
It's been a while since the last time
someone asked for my help.

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:11.840
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.510
You're just a convenience for me.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.850
You seem to have very few friends.

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.560
What do you mean?

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:21.600
Weaklings with a wide connection
tend to try to clump together.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:26.060
They complain, even though they don't
have the power to do much at all.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.900
They go through the motions of
doing unproductive grunt work,

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:32.280
then use their position as the underdog
to look down on those above them.

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:36.280
They are the scum of the world,
who spread stagnation everywhere.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.950
I don't intend to employ anyone like that.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.370
That's because I'm a winner.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:47.330
Winners don't just work
for the sake of working.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:51.420
We got more than we planned.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:55.880
With this, we'll more than make up
for the investment we put in.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:01.220
If we can keep this place to ourselves,
we'd make a ton of money.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.640
The leader will be surprised to see this!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:07.440
That we achieved such great results!

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:09.520
I don't care about that.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:14.360
The most important thing is, how do we
make ourselves personally happy...

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:24.080
Tasty meals found.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:33.670
Hmm? Where?

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:38.970
How did that get here?

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:41.310
Dammit! These expired three years ago!

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:44.810
That old hag messed with me!

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:48.150
Where did you go, food?

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:51.610
Come on, give me a break...

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:54.230
Am I going to die here?!

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.610
No, I can't allow that.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.450
I've finally opened up a path
to victorious NEET-hood...

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:03.450
I won't let that ugly
monster close it off!

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:08.000
I have an idea.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.330
What? What is it?!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.460
You, go and become bait.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.960
Huh? No.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.920
What are you saying?!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.380
Just leave it to me!

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.550
That's super shady!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.890
You and I go way back, right?

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.310
No we don't!

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:27.680
Come on, come on, come on.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:41.990
H-Help! Ninomiya!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.200
He ran off?!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:48.540
Food, yummy...

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:53.040
Father, Mother, I'm sorry.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.090
Please forgive me for leaving
this life before you--

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:57.460
Hold it, big guy!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.920
Ninomiya!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:01.550
Other food...

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:05.310
Are you standing there
because you have a plan?!

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:08.270
I hate being looked down on!

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:09.270
What?!

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:14.360
You, big guy, you can understand
what I'm saying, right?

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:17.820
Not "Big Guy"... I am Rim.

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:21.990
So you have a name, too. Well then, Rim.

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.240
Let's make a deal.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.740
Deal?

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.540
I am an extraordinarily superb human.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:33.540
If, instead of eating us,
you protected us from other monsters,

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.880
until we dig up enough demonite...

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:41.590
I'll get you food that's tastier
than any human, by far!

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:57.360
Interesting, interesting!

00:13:57.360 --> 00:14:01.780
I've never seen any human like you...

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:15.000
Fine.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:29.010
We have a deal. Nice to meet you.

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:36.900
Yes! It's blowing!

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:41.740
The winds of victory are blowing my way,
Kinji Ninomiya!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:49.990
Wow, our team's numbers
grew so much last month!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:54.330
It's all thanks to Ninomiya and his
great job with the prospecting tour!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.170
Thanks so much!

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:00.800
Good luck again today!

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:00.800
Yummy, yummy.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:02.760
Dammit...

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:05.430
How did I end up here...?

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:08.430
That deal was supposed to make
the prospecting tours safe,

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:13.060
and also open up new ways to
make money using this monster.

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:17.350
But I lose more money on food for Rim
than I make through the deal!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.350
Yummy, yummy.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:21.400
I brought the ultimate good-for-nothing
into my household economy!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.820
More...

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:28.660
I have to make more money!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.370
Ninomiya, look...

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.250
Huh?

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.960
There are magic items
strewn about all over this area.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.420
I wonder why?

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.380
Are they valuable?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.600
Looks really worn out.

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:54.730
Oh, that's the toilet area
for Rim and the others.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.100
So these are the things
you couldn't digest...?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.230
Ew, gross!

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:05.940
How come there's no actual crap anywhere?

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:09.450
Everything I digest
becomes magic power, duh.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:12.080
More importantly Kinji, I'm hungry.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.580
How insensitive are you?

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.870
I'm hungry, hungry.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:22.500
Hungry, hungry, hungry, hungry...

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.330
I mean, come on, wait a sec...

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:22.500
I don't carry around food
so conveniently!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.760
If you like, please eat this.

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:33.310
Whoa! He just cut off his own tail!

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:37.270
Don't worry, it grows back.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:42.060
Idling, please input your next command.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:45.230
What's wrong with this guy?
Did he lose his mind?

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:49.820
I smell weird magic powers.
He could be hypnotized or something.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:50.990
Huh?

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.660
Could it be...?

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:57.250
This staff?

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.790
It's happy, fun work time!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:06.000
Work, work you losers!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.670
I can't hear you!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.260
Yes, gladly!

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:15.470
Hey, you! Why are you slacking off?!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.640
My pickaxe broke...

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.310
Then dig with your hands!

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:23.270
Dig until your finger bones break!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.230
Y-Yes...

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.480
Oh, boy...

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:32.780
Oh, what a beautiful thing
this Sleepwalker's Staff is.

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:36.580
A magic item that temporarily
mesmerizes and brainwashes a target,

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:38.870
"Magic Item: 'Sleepwalker's Staff'"
"A license is required to purchase
and use this item."

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:39.160
allowing me to take full control...

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:46.000
Look at them! Look at those dead eyes!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:50.170
♬ Sha-la-la ♬

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:50.170
Not even the most well-trained
corporate drones could look so mindless!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:55.760
Ninomiya, this is bad. You can't
trick and brainwash them like this...

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.680
This is totally a crime.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.350
Stop making it sound so bad!

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:02.900
The amount of demonite we're
digging up is far more than double!

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:06.610
I'm raising their performance
effectively and efficiently!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:11.240
There's nothing wrong with
getting a tiny commission on top!

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:13.530
Huh...?

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:18.580
Why is this person so confident
in the wrong direction...?

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:22.250
And thus, Kinji used
his delirious coworkers

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:26.250
to dig, dig, and dig tons of demonite...

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:33.340
Everything is as it should be.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.800
This is the position
I am destined to be in.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.430
I must continue to fulfill my destiny

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:40.850
of putting drones to good use
under my heel...

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:49.860
Hey, Rim! Wash yourself
before getting in the tub!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:51.650
Can't be bothered.

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:55.570
You're a bother... Hey!
Are you peeing in the tub?!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.740
That feels good.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:02.330
Why am I so tired lately...?

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:07.210
Me, too. I'm not shedding properly,
so my scales are all dried up.

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.630
I feel dizzy...

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:14.260
But you can't argue with these numbers...

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:25.520
Report, remind, review!
Don't forget the "Three R's"! Repeat!

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:28.810
Report, remind, review...

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:33.440
Louder! Let's put some energy into it!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:37.160
How is he so energized...?

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:37.160
Report, remind, review...

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.950
Who knows...

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:39.990
Huh?

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:43.290
No... I don't want to work anymore...

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.500
Help me...

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:49.960
Hey, Rim? Why is that guy
acting so selfishly?

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.670
Is that staff working properly?

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:56.430
Hmm...? It's as it usually is.

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:02.640
Work efficiency is falling lately...

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.020
I should reorganize the teams,
think about the division of labor,

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:07.020
and set clear goals...

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:09.810
Ninomiya!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.480
I bought the potions you asked for.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.480
Good.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:17.490
But the money you gave me wasn't enough
to pay for enough for the whole team...

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:20.410
That's fine, just thin it
with water and hand it out.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.830
That sounds pretty terrible...

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:26.830
We aren't hitting our targets,
it's obviously what we need to do.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.080
Ninomiya...

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.250
Yeah?

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.840
I'll be honest with you,
everyone's at their limit.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:33.800
It won't be long before things fall apart.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:36.510
Why don't you call it off now
and apologize?

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:38.300
That again.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.930
Then how will we make money
moving forward?

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:43.180
If they dig into the facts,

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:47.850
they'll find out about the secret passage
we've been keeping to ourselves.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.150
We'll lose everything.
They're happier being used by me.

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:54.650
Rim, increase the power of the staff.

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:58.700
Wanibe, this experience
reminded me of something.

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:02.320
People support each other.
That's how life works.

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:10.170
Yes...

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:15.300
You can't climb higher without the
"foundations" groveling at your feet!

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:20.840
That's why I must put those losers to
good use and fly higher off their backs!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:27.100
Go, corporate grunts!
Work, work, work till you drop...

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:30.810
Contribute to me, your master!

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.990
Um, uh?

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.710
I'm hungry.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.920
Can't you see...?

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:04.600
You said, if I'm ever not full,
I can eat you, right?

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:06.470
Wait, no...!

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:09.480
Wait!

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:13.600
Kinji Ninomiya, occupation in this
alternate universe: "Corporate Grunt."

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:18.780
Can he escape the sorrow
of black company culture...?
